     "what": "Mesh-LLM plugin: seals a capsule for every exchange a node serves or asks for, including both sides' payment lifecycle events. Latest release <code>v0.1.2</code> (4 Oct 2026). <code>v0.1.0</code> (3 Oct) was the first release. <code>v0.1.1</code> (4 Oct) added the settlement-records legs for paid exchanges: both sides seal their own legs for each invoice (PR #8, merged 3 Oct). <code>v0.1.2</code> registers no inference provider and serves no models unless blocked models are configured. It runs on mesh-llm 0.77 or newer. mesh-llm <code>v0.77.0</code> (28 Sep) carries the payer's payment events (mesh-llm PR #2035). mesh-llm <code>v0.78.0</code> (4 Oct) adds the provider's (mesh-llm PR #2108, closing issue #2017) and the credited amount and fee that the provider's settlement leg needs (mesh-llm PR #2169); on an older host the provider seals no settlement leg.",
